   1           	; =====================================================================
   2           	;  File:   TrabalhoProjeto_p16.s
   3           	;  Desc:   Dice‑roller project – uses FED ticks for timing *only with
   4           	;          instructions available in the P16 ISA* (no pseudo‑ops).
   5           	;          Replace the TIMING CONSTANTS block if the external clock
   6           	;          on the FED is changed (e.g. 100 kHz instead of 10 kHz).
